  "texts": [
    {
      "text": "オアハカのカフェで、エマは店員のルイスに「とてもおなかがすいています」と言います。",
      "textSha256": "e155bfa34c1266aaba77d67f28b5947c26c050240ce3711c4ba4bb4d23687d94",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:4",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:4:ja-en:reader:source-scene-v1:oaxaca-hungry",
      "kind": "reader"
    },
    {
      "text": "生搾りのオレンジジュースはありますか。",
      "textSha256": "6edabe38c20045b95033746a6f57a8fff54d21da41b4341c2f28edd3ef79d564",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:4",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:4:ja-en:reader:source-scene-v1:ask-natural-juice",
      "kind": "reader"
    },
    {
      "text": "はい、あります。朝食には新鮮な果物もあります。",
      "textSha256": "05bf2e6e5d9319b9875c41f2d24d088b0ff59cca4cf57e66927ed8d3e0c52914",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:4",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:4:ja-en:reader:source-scene-v1:yes-fruit",
      "kind": "reader"
    },
    {
      "text": "トーストはありますか。",
      "textSha256": "93beb23cd485276a4747c3fcccbae4080339c4408e872791f2e35f0ee2b67459",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:4",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:4:ja-en:reader:source-scene-v1:ask-toast",
      "kind": "reader"
    },
    {
      "text": "はい、トーストにはバターとジャムがつきます。",
      "textSha256": "0852fa1d81fe62f4d4e5a20b3eb4c2a44c6dc38993111d5ad8c05aecbfc9a5e0",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:4",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:4:ja-en:reader:source-scene-v1:toast-butter-jam",
      "kind": "reader"
    },
    {
      "text": "砂糖なしのお茶とスプーンをお願いします。",
      "textSha256": "0e1dd25d5a0569cfb8424425ff8eb12dc66770f8ccfd958700b6e5c4be9a4b3f",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:4",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:4:ja-en:reader:source-scene-v1:tea-spoon",
      "kind": "reader"
    },
    {
      "text": "フォークとナプキンも必要です。いただけますか。",
      "textSha256": "1b12bd33eaa509edf02e9edc5a4ea3fee015fb815c282228178ba354d92179ae",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:4",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:4:ja-en:reader:source-scene-v1:need-fork-napkin",
      "kind": "reader"
    },
    {
      "text": "かしこまりました。お会計は食後にレジでお願いします。",
      "textSha256": "236838309534bec6dd68c768142c20cee42daa6418d16eb50409df6fd8d8bfda",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:4",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:4:ja-en:reader:source-scene-v1:pay-register",
      "kind": "reader"
    },
    {
      "text": "生搾りのオレンジジュースはありますか",
      "textSha256": "4186b858a5797f8b6d47e501ea587276c00a1e88795585a8bebe6e04e4dc79b7",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:4",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:4:ja-en:card:source-scene-v1:ask-natural-orange-juice",
      "kind": "card"
    },
    {
      "text": "新鮮な果物",
      "textSha256": "b0eec243b3b89a2a3e749beb1fd01b78f1cb12d123f405bbbb08b0072361538e",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:4",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:4:ja-en:card:source-scene-v1:fresh-fruit",
      "kind": "card"
    },
    {
      "text": "バターとジャム",
      "textSha256": "d1c498042283dcb2f1f8748fa88ffa38883faaf4210845653c984712c982e07d",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:4",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:4:ja-en:card:source-scene-v1:butter-and-jam",
      "kind": "card"
    },
    {
      "text": "アンナはオアハカのカフェで、朝食に卵料理を食べ、コーヒーを飲みます。",
      "textSha256": "9efd8a2570fd788419cd2a61b5e43751ac1615f1f514ed6cf9ba86e3817afa9d",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:9",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:9:ja-en:reader:source-scene-v1:oaxaca-breakfast",
      "kind": "reader"
    },
    {
      "text": "お水を一杯いただけますか。",
      "textSha256": "6ade6e905a14027f17cbe6227ee832eaea1cd8f7c2383ee1f4433e7ec892cf27",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:9",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:9:ja-en:reader:source-scene-v1:ask-water",
      "kind": "reader"
    },
    {
      "text": "店員のルイスは、氷入りの水とストローを持ってきます。",
      "textSha256": "c330b33c2d5d68df6a0f22a9f802449579eeaabdfa030b193ad71d3af0ba147d",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:9",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:9:ja-en:reader:source-scene-v1:water-ice-straw",
      "kind": "reader"
    },
    {
      "text": "お塩を持ってきていただけますか。",
      "textSha256": "8ff116b844f8090b81f2e38f022349f1a97b176548a3ffe1dae124c1ed45839b",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:9",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:9:ja-en:reader:source-scene-v1:ask-salt",
      "kind": "reader"
    },
    {
      "text": "クリームをもっと持ってきてください。",
      "textSha256": "8912ed07e04fd1175203f7ea7af521da29726427a397c57233d3cd6297fdbb61",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:9",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:9:ja-en:reader:source-scene-v1:ask-cream",
      "kind": "reader"
    },
    {
      "text": "お会計をお願いできますか。",
      "textSha256": "1602886a1dd29f92c89c197cd04edd66bcdac2fca955d5699e3d2876464739a6",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:9",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:9:ja-en:reader:source-scene-v1:ask-bill",
      "kind": "reader"
    },
    {
      "text": "カードと現金、どちらでお支払いになりますか。",
      "textSha256": "7d6259bbd2243390ebc360eedfbe7673de431f690968551bff431391a28c49b4",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:9",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:9:ja-en:reader:source-scene-v1:card-or-cash",
      "kind": "reader"
    },
    {
      "text": "現金で払います。二百ペソ、どうぞ。",
      "textSha256": "6d7ff36ea13a08c1a3fafeb03fb86744745090666b87dc9e27029ec2d4507574",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:9",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:9:ja-en:reader:source-scene-v1:cash-two-hundred-pesos",
      "kind": "reader"
    },
    {
      "text": "おつりはチップとしてどうぞ。",
      "textSha256": "cf73fb84ddb75fe038e6109c735259fa1f3a5d5b474e393182aa7bb12355f4fb",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:9",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:9:ja-en:reader:source-scene-v1:change-as-tip",
      "kind": "reader"
    },
    {
      "text": "チップ",
      "textSha256": "dfdd13f77dfc4a39ca4cd8f1375b1e377057817d88d5280d5b4a9a909a5a30d7",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:9",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:9:ja-en:card:source-scene-v1:tip",
      "kind": "card"
    },
    {
      "text": "塩",
      "textSha256": "4bcde772e50edeb6f1f019ea84f9b96878cf7a56f33f4e6f2bc3f14ce30815e7",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:9",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:9:ja-en:card:source-scene-v1:salt",
      "kind": "card"
    },
    {
      "text": "ストロー",
      "textSha256": "b9ebae53389b385915dba78ddf7ca265cc00df150e9e94c4d41543695d681647",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:9",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:9:ja-en:card:source-scene-v1:straw",
      "kind": "card"
    },
    {
      "text": "クリーム",
      "textSha256": "497913e6bcfd211d6c662c7fa3799180e05da6e2629a17a040e09ff074d86b27",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:9",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:9:ja-en:card:source-scene-v1:cream",
      "kind": "card"
    },
    {
      "text": "氷",
      "textSha256": "52364d87653a2607738a39db8f9fda3b948a3256bad83b19299ebd63bc9811e3",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:9",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:9:ja-en:card:source-scene-v1:ice",
      "kind": "card"
    },
    {
      "text": "チップは含まれていますか",
      "textSha256": "5f58eeae2c67ca3a44692e21598df7eec97a80b5a53f87b82eb00bf92ecde651",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:9",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:9:ja-en:card:source-scene-v1:tip-included-question",
      "kind": "card"
    },
    {
      "text": "おつりはチップとしてどうぞ",
      "textSha256": "e6b98080574268a30dc574bb74ffa007376fb946e876153b9f5cd2d925dc5deb",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:9",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:9:ja-en:card:source-scene-v1:keep-change-as-tip",
